{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2023-02-24 16:30:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA , FEB. 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 58 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON APRIL 20, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 31, 2023. \xa0 ABOUT FMC FMC CORPORATION IS A GLOBAL AGRICULTURAL SCIENCES COMPANY DEDICATED TO HELPING GROWERS PRODUCE FOOD, FEED, FIBER AND FUEL FOR AN EXPANDING WORLD POPULATION WHILE ADAPTING TO A CHANGING ENVIRONMENT.'}